      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "The secret of Lake Yantar is similar to the secret of the Brain Scorcher and their effects are similar in many ways. Some kind of emission zombifies all who come in contact with it. The zombified stalkers move around the center of some emitter, attacking everyone. There is information to suggest that the solution to the riddle of Lake Yantar is below ground. Here are the coordinates of the emitter at Lake Yantar and those of the Brain Scorcher.",
      "JA_current": "Yantar 湖の秘密は、色々な意味で Brain Scorcher と、その影響との関係が持つ秘密にそっくりだ。どんな放射も、それに接触するもの全てをゾンビ化する。ゾンビ化されたストーカーたちは、誰彼構わず襲いながら、放射体の中心を彷徨う。Yantar 湖の謎の答えが地面の下にあることを示す情報がある。これが、 Yantar 湖の放射体と Brain Scorcher の座標だ。",
